      "parameters": {
        "content": "## The Business Story (Why Are We Building This?)\n\nIn an un-automated business, this process is slow and painful:\nAn operator sits at a computer daily, manually checks Google Forms responses, and copies-pastes them into a giant Google Sheet.\n\nA sales manager manually scrolls through the sheet, checks if the email is a real company or personal email, and tags them as \"Qualified\".\n\nFor every qualified lead, the manager manually:\n1. Types a message in Slack: \"Hey team, new lead!\"\n2. Opens Notion and creates a task card: \"Call John Doe\".\n3. Opens Airtable and creates a new CRM record.\n\nThe Problem: Leads wait hours or days for a response, and human error causes leads to slip through the cracks.\n\nThe Solution: This n8n workflow does all of this in less than 2 seconds automatically.",
        "height": 384,
        "width": 1152
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -800,
        -640
